31:["$","p","p-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Rule of thumb:"}]," if the car would sit empty for most of the time, book per trip. If you would otherwise need three or more separate rides in a day, an hourly or full-day booking is usually simpler — and often cheaper than stacking single trips."]}]
32:["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"what-changes-the-price","children":"What changes the price"}]
33:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"vehicle-class","children":"Vehicle class"}]
34:["$","p","p-2",{"children":["The biggest single factor. Through our partner network you can book an ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"executive sedan"}]," (Toyota Camry, Ford Taurus, Genesis G80 class), a ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"full-size SUV"}]," (GMC Yukon XL, Cadillac Escalade), a ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"van"}]," (Hyundai Staria), a ",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"luxury"}]," car (Mercedes S-Class, BMW 7 Series) or a ",["$","strong","strong-4",{"children":"minibus/coaster"}]," for groups. Larger and more premium vehicles cost more per hour and per trip. See ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/fleet","children":"vehicle classes and capacities"}]," before you choose — paying for an SUV when a sedan fits your group is the most common way to overspend."]}]
35:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"hours-and-distance","children":"Hours and distance"}]
36:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Hourly hire is mostly about time, but distance still counts: a day that stays inside Riyadh is priced differently from a day that includes a run out to Diriyah and back, or a trip from Jeddah up to Makkah. Tell us the rough route, not just the number of hours."}]
37:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"city-and-timing","children":"City and timing"}]
38:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"Pricing is consistent in approach across cities, but availability differs — Makkah and Madinah in Ramadan, or Riyadh during major exhibitions and Riyadh Season, are busier than a quiet weekday. The earlier you book for those periods, the more vehicle choice you have. Late-night starts and very early airport runs are normal and can be booked like any other time."}]
39:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"what-does-not-change-it","children":"What does not change it"}]
3a:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["Traffic and demand do not move the fare after you have agreed it. There is ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"no meter and no surge"}]," — the price you confirm before booking is the price for the trip you described."]}]
3b:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"what-is-included-and-what-to-clarify","children":"What is included — and what to clarify"}]
3c:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The driver and vehicle for the booked period."}]," On an hourly or full-day booking, the driver waits between your stops; that waiting is what you are paying for."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Fuel"}]," is part of the quote for the trip you describe."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Changes on the day"}]," — an unplanned extra city, or running well past your booked hours — need agreeing with us, because they change the trip."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Payment"}]," is by cash to the driver or by bank transfer, and ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"electronic receipts"}]," are available on request. For company bookings, a company invoice can be provided on request."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Cancellation"}]," is free up to 24 hours before pickup."]}],"\n"]}]
3d:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"typical-uses-and-which-model-fits","children":"Typical uses, and which model fits"}]
3e:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"a-day-of-meetings-in-riyadh","children":"A day of meetings in Riyadh"}]
3f:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["Olaya in the morning, KAFD at lunch, the Diplomatic Quarter in the afternoon, then dinner. Booked as single rides that is four or five pickups to coordinate; booked by the hour, the same driver is outside each building when you come out. Most business visitors take an ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/locations/riyadh/private-driver","children":"executive sedan or SUV by the hour"}],"."]}]
40:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"ziyarat-in-makkah-or-madinah","children":"Ziyarat in Makkah or Madinah"}]
41:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["The historic sites are spread out and stops are short. A few hours with one car and driver is the usual way to do it — see ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/services/makkah-ziyarat","children":"Makkah Ziyarat"}]," and ",["$","$L25","a-1",{"href":"/services/madinah-ziyarat","children":"Madinah Ziyarat"}],"."]}]
42:["$","h3","h3-6",{"id":"airport-arrival-plus-an-afternoon-of-appointments","children":"Airport arrival plus an afternoon of appointments"}]
43:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"Book the airport transfer per trip and add a few hours to the same booking, rather than arranging a second car once you've checked in."}]
44:["$","h3","h3-7",{"id":"a-family-day-trip-out-of-the-city","children":"A family day trip out of the city"}]
45:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"Diriyah from Riyadh, Taif from Makkah, or Al-Balad and the Corniche in Jeddah. A full-day booking with a van or SUV keeps everyone together and leaves room for shopping bags."}]
46:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"private-driver-or-ride-hailing-app","children":"Private driver or ride-hailing app?"}]
47:["$","p","p-10",{"children":"Ride-hailing apps work well for short, single trips when you have mobile data and no luggage. They are less suited to days with several stops: you re-book each leg, the car and driver change each time, and prices can rise at busy times. A pre-booked private driver costs more than the cheapest app ride, but gives you one agreed price, one vehicle that waits, and a driver who already knows the day's plan — which is why business travellers, families with children and first-time visitors usually choose it."}]
48:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"how-to-get-an-exact-price","children":"How to get an exact price"}]
49:["$","p","p-11",{"children":["Send us four things: ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"city, date and start time, a rough list of stops, and the number of passengers and bags."}]," We reply with the vehicle class that fits and a fixed price for that plan. If the plan changes before the day, tell us and the quote is updated before you travel."]}]
4a:["$","h2","h2-6",{"id":"common-questions","children":"Common questions"}]
4b:["$","h3","h3-8",{"id":"is-there-a-minimum-booking-for-hourly-hire","children":"Is there a minimum booking for hourly hire?"}]
4c:["$","p","p-12",{"children":"Usually yes — hourly bookings have a minimum number of hours. Ask when you book and we'll confirm it for your city and vehicle."}]
4d:["$","h3","h3-9",{"id":"can-i-book-a-driver-for-several-days","children":"Can I book a driver for several days?"}]
4e:["$","p","p-13",{"children":"Yes, you can book consecutive days. Give us each day's outline and we quote the whole period together."}]
4f:["$","h3","h3-10",{"id":"do-drivers-speak-english","children":"Do drivers speak English?"}]
